        { "coTank", false, "A small health bar for the other tank in your group, shown while you are tanking: tank role, Bear Form, Defensive Stance or Righteous Fury. The other tank is whoever has the tank role or the raid's Main Tank assignment. Click it to target them. Changes made in combat apply when the fight ends. Move it in the HUD Editor.", "Co-Tank Frame", false, false },
