        { "spellQueue", "Spell Queue Window", "How early you can press your next spell before the current one finishes, in milliseconds. 100 to 400 suits most: lower is more responsive, higher is more forgiving of latency. Melee around your ping + 100, ranged around your ping + 150.", "Spell Queue", false, false },
